{title: Aye Zindagi Dheere Se Chal}
{artist: Sonu Nigam Vishal Mishra}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Aye [Gm]zindagi [Cm]Dheere se [Gm]chal,        [Cm]Aye [Gm]zindagi [Cm]Dheere se [Gm]chal
Kahi [D#]hatho se na lamhaa [F]fisal jaye,        Kahi [D#]aisa na ho chu ke [F]guzar jaye
[D#]Khul ke tjhko [A#]galey laga lu [G]zara,        [A#]Tham ja
[Cm]Aye [G]zindagi [Cm]Dheere se [G]chal,        [Cm]Taaro bhari [G]is raat mein
[D#]chaand zaruri [A#]hain,        [Cm]Tera mere [G]paas yaha
[D#]hona zaruri [A#]hain,        [G#]Tumhey apni [A#]aankho se [D#]me [G]
[G#]Choo oonga to [A#]chain [D#]ay [G]ega,        Kahi [D#]aisa na ho adha hi [F]reh jaye
Khwaab [D#]mera khi khali na [F]ghr jaye,        [D#]Khul ke tuzko [A#]gale laga lu [G]zara
[A#]Tham jaa,        [Cm]Aye [G]zindagi [Cm]Dheere se [G]chal
Barso se [C]me [G]tere pyaar [F]me,        [F]Rota bhi hu, hasta bhi [C]hu
[G]Kbhi kaash [F]kuch [A#]aisa bhi ho,        Tu bhi [D#]mere liye do [F]boond ro jaye
Teri [D#]baato me jo mera [F]jikar aye,        [D#]Khul ke tujhko [A#]gale laga lu [G]zara
[A#]Tham ja,        [Cm]Aye [G]zindagi [Cm]Dheere se [G]chal
